    "ExecJ6Bind.capture-binding-check.py being a byte copy of the committed instrument may indicate the seat copied early rather than writing the requested patch.",
    "The J5 outside limb scans recursively; a shared --scratch-root parent containing another seat's export tree produces a spurious outside=<n> red in the frozen counting command.",
    "The r41-shaped selftest costs real 5m47s (user 32m30s) at base; the r42 suite should keep nested negative controls to one pass per control with a depth guard."
