      "The two raw row-count greps are satisfiable by the twin (frontier 25, registry 64 read the after-state values on a forged tree), so a counter-only reading of C2 would not catch a forgery; the claim's conjunction does.",
      "P5 (a self-consistent forgery carrying a capture, an entry and a harness pass) is green on all three local instruments: these instruments verify binding and self-consistency, not upstream truth. The O4 class is rejected by consistency checks, not by an upstream-truth check; the lane's own admission bar covers that.",
